# PLAN-939 T-11 (D-939-CE-1 bridge arm): the CE direction — Auto source
# EXPORTED through the C library fileset and EXECUTED by independent
# hand-audited C callers (the S01 text-view and S02 record lanes the
# §5.8 matrix marks "CE 必需"). The certify-path arm (exported resource
# functions inside the source-import certification) stays the D-960-1
# named successor — the 934 signature-facts vocabulary is not extended
# here.

# S01 CE: cold publish (facts+plan+fragment+library), pure second-query
# hit (zero producers), exit 0 = every hand-computed byte-length oracle
# passed (NUL as data, multibyte, decomposed accent, len0).
```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "ace-ca-d3.ce-text-view"
  tags: ["ca-d3", "probe", "certify"]
  source: { file: "src/ce-text-view.atomdata", syntax: "atom-data", path: "ce-text-view.atomdata" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "certify", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "abi/ca-d1-bridge-v1",
        abi: { leg: "source" },
        steps: [ { op: "query" }, { op: "query" } ]
      },
      expect: { completion: "success", exit: 0, probe: [
        { cache: "published", stages_include: ["bridge"] },
        { cache: "hit", compute_calls: 0 }
      ] } }
  ]
}
```

